<title>USA: Electro Rent seeing pickup in business.</title>
<headline>Electro Rent seeing pickup in business.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electro Rent Corp said Monday the soft business trends that hurt sales and earnings in its fourth quarter have started to show improvement in the beginning of fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>&quot;We experienced some softness in March and April, Daniel Greenberg, chairman and chief executive officer said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;But business began picking up in May, allowing us to end the quarter on a more positive note.  Improving business trends are continuing in the first two months of fiscal 1998,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
